  "scope": "A derived complete four-dimensional Cartesian Hermite basis and a surjective physical transform into l2(N^4; L2(clock, neutral frequency)), with exact norm-convergent reconstruction. The actual physical circle action splits into charged and spectator factors and is intertwined with an explicit convergent Hermite matrix series. The entire maximal standing-charge graph, its domain, fixed sector and zero projection are identified in this representation. No diagonal occupation-charge law, maximal spectral Hamiltonian domain, fiber energy multiplicity, or Watson/R1 physical identification is claimed."
}
